            "review_text": "Tan H\n7 contributions\n0\nHustlet by waitress in Sumo BBQ, don’t go there.\nJul 2019 • Couples\nI was dating koreansk bbq, when the Bill came it came in a book.\n\nTotal Bill was: 1.002.000\nI pause with 2x 500.000 notes and a 2000 note.\nLeft it in the book and Walked out.\n\nOn my Way out, the waitress came running saying there was a wrong payment. She claimed there was 552.000 thousand, and told me i mistook the 50.000 with a 500.000 note. I know for sure i did not, but was forced to pay.\n\nShe has swap the note herself and blaming me. Never coming back. Food was even very bad and the beef felt like rubber.\nRead more\nWritten July 4, 2019",
